<hr/>
  <h3>INI field format is indicated at the parametre /FITXER_ORDRE_GRUP</h3>
  <pre>
[ORDRE_GRUP]
Atributte1=
Atributte2=
Atributte3=
...
</pre>(The index attribute must be correlative. The key values
is the attribute value of the polygons)

 
  <hr/>
  This program support REL v.4 format and ARC v. 1.1 format with or without 3D
  coordinates.<br/>

